OoT's menu text: shadow every form of the common ALU operations next to the extended uniform
bank, not only the forms 99zzzw listed. The operand form (bits 9-11) places the register operands,
so IMAD.HI with an immediate (0x827), where the last menu-text compute shader stopped on 00.067.002,
and the other immediate, constant and uniform forms are covered, as are IABS, I2FP, F2I, LDG with
register address words (0x381) and IMAD with a uniform addend (form 7), which the same shader
(dumped on 00.067.003) also uses on high registers. Bumps the translator salt.

